	measure 'Available Pairs' = ```
			
			 var a = SELECTEDVALUE('Date'[Fiscal Year-Period (544)])
			 return
			 if(SELECTEDVALUE(Orders[Sales Order Type])="Framework Order 001",
			 CALCULATE([Reserved Units]+[Allocated Units],filter(Orders,Orders[Fill Date - Order]<[lastperdate])),
			 CALCULATE([Reserved units]+[Allocated Units],filter(Orders,Orders[Fill Date - Cust Req #]<[lastperdate])))
			```
